  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You redirect attacks with precision and power.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Elusive Redirection<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can use this feat as a free action whenever you use your elusive target class feature. If you expend one use of mythic power as a free action when redirecting an attack, using this feat does not require expenditure of a point from your ki pool and the attack and damage rolls for the attack you redirect gain a bonus equal to one-half your mythic tier (minimum +1).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc120\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
